#version 450
// FakeQuantizeLSQ ∂L/∂s[c]: sum_i ψ(x_i/s) * dy_i
// ψ(z) = -z + round(z) inside range, sign(z)·q_max outside.
// One work-item per channel.
layout(local_size_x = 64) in;

layout(push_constant) uniform PC {
    uint n;
    uint chan_dim;
    uint inner;
    float q_max;
    uint x_off;
    uint scale_off;
    uint dy_off;
    uint dscale_off;
} pc;

float round_half_away(float x) {
    return sign(x) * floor(abs(x) + 0.5);
}

float lsq_psi(float z) {
    if (abs(z) <= pc.q_max) {
        return -z + round_half_away(z);
    }
    return (z > 0.0) ? pc.q_max : -pc.q_max;
}

void main() {
    uint c = gl_GlobalInvocationID.x;
    if (c >= pc.chan_dim) { return; }
    float s = max(arena_load(pc.scale_off + c), 1e-12);

    float acc = 0.0;
    uint stride = pc.chan_dim * pc.inner;
    uint outer = (stride == 0u) ? 0u : (pc.n / stride);

    if (outer * stride == pc.n) {
        for (uint o = 0u; o < outer; o++) {
            uint base = o * stride + c * pc.inner;
            for (uint j = 0u; j < pc.inner; j++) {
                uint idx = base + j;
                float z = arena_load(pc.x_off + idx) / s;
                acc += lsq_psi(z) * arena_load(pc.dy_off + idx);
            }
        }
    } else {
        for (uint i = 0u; i < pc.n; i++) {
            uint ch = (pc.chan_dim <= 1u) ? 0u : ((i / pc.inner) % pc.chan_dim);
            if (ch == c) {
                float z = arena_load(pc.x_off + i) / s;
                acc += lsq_psi(z) * arena_load(pc.dy_off + i);
            }
        }
    }
    arena_store(pc.dscale_off + c, acc);
}
